  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Conduktor Gateway Lifecycle - by Interceptor",
      "id": 1,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 3,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "This dashboard breaks down Conduktor Gateway **interceptor** latency **per interceptor**, so you can see which interceptors add the most processing time on the request and response paths. Read more in [Gateway request lifecycle metrics](https://docs.conduktor.io/guide/conduktor-in-production/monitor/gateway_lifecycle_metrics).\n\nGateway runs interceptors at two points in the request lifecycle, and this dashboard has one row for each:\n\n- `request.interceptor` (T2 -> T3) - interceptors applied to the incoming request, before it is sent to the Kafka broker\n- `response.interceptor` (T7 -> T8) - interceptors applied to the broker response, before it is returned to the client\n\nWithin each row, the three panels show **mean** latency, **max** latency and **rate** (samples/s), with one line per interceptor. Use the **pod** and **Interceptor** dropdowns above to filter which pods and interceptors are shown.\n\nNote: a missing or zero series means no traffic passed through that interceptor for the selected filters. For the full end-to-end stage breakdown, see the **Lifecycle - Overview** dashboard."
      },
      "datasource": null
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "request.interceptor (T2 -> T3)",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3
      },
      "id": 10,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "Mean latency by interceptor for request.interceptor (T2 -> T3).",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "axisBorderShow": false,
            "axisCenteredZero": false,
            "axisColorMode": "text",
            "axisLabel": "",
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "barAlignment": 0,
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "gradientMode": "none",
            "hideFrom": {
              "legend": false,
              "tooltip": false,
              "viz": false
            },
            "insertNulls": false,
            "lineInterpolation": "linear",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "pointSize": 1,
            "scaleDistribution": {
              "type": "linear"
            },
            "showPoints": "auto",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": {
              "group": "A",
              "mode": "none"
            },
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "off"
            }
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4
      },
      "id": 100,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [],
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single",
          "sort": "none"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum by(interceptor) (rate(gateway_request_interceptor_duration_seconds_sum{job=\"$job\", pod=~\"$pod\", interceptor=~\"$interceptor\"}[$__rate_interval])) / sum by(interceptor) (rate(gateway_request_interceptor_duration_seconds_count{job=\"$job\", pod=~\"$pod\", interceptor=~\"$interceptor\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{interceptor}}",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "mean by interceptor",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
